# Fractal compression — context for agents

## Project

- **Purpose:** Thesis-oriented **fractal image compression** research; comparative benchmarks. Reference implementation is **Java**; **C++** and **Python** are planned — keep shared artifacts **language-neutral** where possible.
- **Layout:** `algorithms/` (docs), `data/images/` (inputs), `implementations/java/compression/` (main Java module), **`benchmarks/`** (cross-language run record spec + `registry.jsonl`). See root `README.md` table.

## Versioning and changelog

- Follow **[versioning-and-releases.mdc](versioning-and-releases.mdc)** (`0.x.0` ↔ `feature/x-...`; **main** = **`0.4.0`** benchmark-registry checkpoint). Add notable work under the correct **`CHANGELOG.md`** section.

## Benchmark run record (shared contract)

- **Spec:** [`benchmarks/RUN_RECORD.md`](benchmarks/RUN_RECORD.md) — JSON lines in **`benchmarks/registry.jsonl`**; each line is one object with **`schema_version`**, **`runner`** (`language`, `id`, `version`), core metrics, optional **`host`**, optional **`extras`** for non-Java fields.
- **Java** emits **`runner.language: "java"`**, default **`runner.id: "java-compression"`**; override with **`BENCHMARK_RUNNER_ID`** / **`BENCHMARK_RUNNER_VERSION`**. **`BENCHMARK_GIT_SHA`** is set by [`implementations/java/benchmarks/run_matrix.sh`](implementations/java/benchmarks/run_matrix.sh).
- **Future C++/Python** should match the same **core** field names when appending to `registry.jsonl`.

## Java module (`implementations/java/compression/`)

- **Entry:** `run.sh` → `Main` → **`PGMAPipeline`**. Optional **`--skip-compression`** (**`-sc`**) / **`--skip-decompression`** (**`-sd`**) for phase-isolated runs (manifest flags **`skip_compression`** / **`skip_decompression`**). Outputs live under **`processes/<stem>/`** (relative to module cwd: **`FileUtils.PROCESSES_ROOT`** resolves to repo `processes/`).
- **Per stem:** `codebook_r{r}_d{d}.fc` (geometry-specific), `original.pgm`, `iterations/` (PGMs + `benchmark.csv`), `baselines/` (PNG + zip baselines), `run_manifest.json`. **Same stem re-runs overwrite** iteration outputs under that folder; **`registry.jsonl` still appends** one line per successful run.
- **Benchmarks package:** `src/benchmarks/` — `RunManifest`, `RunnerInfo`, `HostEnvironmentMetrics`, `MemorySampler`, `BenchmarkRegistry`, etc. Baseline I/O: `src/utils/baselines/CompressionBaselines.java`.
- **Matrix batch:** [`matrix.compression-pgma.txt`](implementations/java/benchmarks/matrix.compression-pgma.txt) (**lena** only; explicit **(range, domain)** pairs; **`-p`/`-P`** 1…16; regenerate via [`generate_compression_pgma_matrix.py`](implementations/java/benchmarks/generate_compression_pgma_matrix.py)) and [`matrix.decompression-pgma.txt`](implementations/java/benchmarks/matrix.decompression-pgma.txt) (decode / **`-p` 8**, **`-P`**, **`-i`**); index [`matrix.all-pgma.txt`](implementations/java/benchmarks/matrix.all-pgma.txt), [`run_matrix.sh`](implementations/java/benchmarks/run_matrix.sh), [`run_pgma_matrices.sh`](implementations/java/benchmarks/run_pgma_matrices.sh).

